### 3. Business Analytics & Frequency Counters (Trophy Deciders)

| KPI | Business Use | How `Counter` Is Used |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Top Goal Scorer (Golden Boot)** | Identify the season’s best striker for the end‑of‑year award. | Extract `player_id` from all *Goal* events across all completed matches and count frequencies. |
| **Most Assists (Playmaker Award)** | Reward the best creative player. | Extract `player_id` from all *Assist* events and count frequencies. |
| **Most Disciplined Team** | Award a fair‑play trophy to the team with the fewest cards. | Count all *Yellow* and *Red* card events per team (nested lookup: event → player → team). |
| **Most Popular Venue** | Decide which venue gets priority for the finals (based on usage). | Count all matches scheduled per venue code. |
| **Referee Workload** | If referees were added (optional), count how many matches each referee officiates. | (This can be added as a stretch, but keep it simple: top venues & players). |
| **Division Parity** | Count wins per team in a division to ensure no team is too dominant (for balancing next season). | Count `win` outcomes per team ID from the standings. |

